    "exact_delta_sha256": "bbf66a9c3dec53bfb97637630b374ab00e263729339b615b46772fd36ad02f0d",
    "exact_delta_text": "Proposed addition to docs/skills/repository-operations.md beside the OAuth build-source guard:\n\nGenerated and manual OAuth artifact producers install Runtime through `inv install` or `inv devinstall` before `inv build-oauth2-config`. Those install tasks populate Runtime's Poetry environment, where PyYAML is declared; they do not guarantee YAML is importable in the outer Invoke interpreter. Keep the outer task's acquisition/validation entry point delegated to Runtime Poetry and test that actual delegation with a controlled source. Recovery invokes the task from immutable `release-source/action_server`, so its installed environment and task version belong to that source; a current helper change does not repair an older release target.\n",
